{"seq":2,"slug":"message-schema-evolution","title":"消息 Schema 演进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/message-schema-evolution","wordCount":767,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"消息-schema-演进策略\">消息 Schema 演进策略</h1><p>消息系统中，生产者和消费者独立部署、独立升级。当消息格式（Schema）发生变化时，新版生产者可能与旧版消费者共存，反之亦然。这一问题被称为 <strong>Schema 演进（Schema Evolution）</strong>。没有经过设计的 Schema 演进是生产事故的高发地——一个字段重命名就能导致消费者大规模解析失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Schema 演进</td>\n<td>消息格式随时间变化，需保持生产者和消费者兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向后兼容</td>\n<td>新版 Schema 能正确解析旧版消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向前兼容</td>\n<td>旧版 Schema 能正确解析新版消息（忽略新增字段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema Registry</td>\n<td>集中存储和管理 Schema 版本的服务，支持兼容性校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Upcasting</td>\n<td>读取时将旧版事件格式升级到新版的转换机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"schema-兼容性类型\">Schema 兼容性类型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兼容性类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>向后兼容</strong>（Backward）</td>\n<td>新 Schema 能读旧数据</td>\n<td>消费者可以先升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>向前兼容</strong>（Forward）</td>\n<td>旧 Schema 能读新数据</td>\n<td>生产者可以先升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>完全兼容</strong>（Full）</td>\n<td>同时满足向前和向后</td>\n<td>两端可以任意顺序升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>不兼容</strong></td>\n<td>两者都不满足</td>\n<td>需要协调同步升级，风险最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    OLD_P[旧版生产者\\nSchema v1] --&gt;|写入消息| MQ[(消息队列)]&#10;    NEW_P[新版生产者\\nSchema v2] --&gt;|写入消息| MQ&#10;    MQ --&gt; OLD_C[旧版消费者\\nSchema v1]&#10;    MQ --&gt; NEW_C[新版消费者\\nSchema v2]&#10;&#10;    note1[向后兼容: NEW_C 能读 v1 消息]&#10;    note2[向前兼容: OLD_C 能读 v2 消息]\">flowchart LR\n    OLD_P[旧版生产者\\nSchema v1] --&gt;|写入消息| MQ[(消息队列)]\n    NEW_P[新版生产者\\nSchema v2] --&gt;|写入消息| MQ\n    MQ --&gt; OLD_C[旧版消费者\\nSchema v1]\n    MQ --&gt; NEW_C[新版消费者\\nSchema v2]\n\n    note1[向后兼容: NEW_C 能读 v1 消息]\n    note2[向前兼容: OLD_C 能读 v2 消息]</pre><h2 id=\"安全的-schema-变更操作\">安全的 Schema 变更操作</h2><p><strong>向后兼容的安全变更</strong>（推荐）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新增可选字段（带默认值）</li>\n<li>删除带默认值的字段</li>\n<li>扩宽数值类型（int32 → int64）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>破坏兼容性的危险变更</strong>（需特别处理）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>删除无默认值的必填字段</li>\n<li>重命名字段（等价于删除旧字段 + 新增新字段）</li>\n<li>修改字段类型（string → int）</li>\n<li>修改字段语义（price: 元 → 分）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"protobuf-schema-演进\">Protobuf Schema 演进</h2><p>Protobuf 通过字段编号（Field Number）识别字段，字段名可以变化，编号不能复用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// v1 Schema&#10;message Order {&#10;  int64 order_id = 1;&#10;  string user_id = 2;&#10;  double amount = 3;  // 安全：可以弃用但不要删除编号 3&#10;}&#10;&#10;// v2 Schema（向后兼容）&#10;message Order {&#10;  int64 order_id = 1;&#10;  string user_id = 2;&#10;  // double amount = 3;  // 弃用，不复用编号 3&#10;  int64 amount_cents = 4;  // 新字段：金额改为分（新编号 4）&#10;  string currency = 5;     // 新增可选字段&#10;&#10;  reserved 3;              // 预留编号 3，防止被误用&#10;  reserved &quot;amount&quot;;       // 预留字段名&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// v1 Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message Order {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 order_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string user_id = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  double amount = 3;  // 安全：可以弃用但不要删除编号 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// v2 Schema（向后兼容）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message Order {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 order_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string user_id = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // double amount = 3;  // 弃用，不复用编号 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 amount_cents = 4;  // 新字段：金额改为分（新编号 4）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string currency = 5;     // 新增可选字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reserved 3;              // 预留编号 3，防止被误用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reserved \"amount\";       // 预留字段名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"avro-与-schema-registry\">Avro 与 Schema Registry</h2><p>Apache Avro 要求写入时记录 Schema ID，读取时从 <strong>Schema Registry</strong> 获取对应 Schema 解码：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as Producer&#10;    participant SR as Schema Registry&#10;    participant K as Kafka&#10;    participant C as Consumer&#10;&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;SR: POST /subjects/orders-value\\n注册 Schema v2&#10;    SR--&gt;&gt;P: Schema ID = 42&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;K: 发布消息(Magic Byte + SchemaID=42 + Avro Data)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;K: 消费消息,读取 SchemaID=42&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;SR: GET /schemas/ids/42&#10;    SR--&gt;&gt;C: Schema v2 定义&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: 用 Schema v2 解码消息\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as Producer\n    participant SR as Schema Registry\n    participant K as Kafka\n    participant C as Consumer\n\n    P-&gt;&gt;SR: POST /subjects/orders-value\\n注册 Schema v2\n    SR--&gt;&gt;P: Schema ID = 42\n    P-&gt;&gt;K: 发布消息(Magic Byte + SchemaID=42 + Avro Data)\n    C-&gt;&gt;K: 消费消息,读取 SchemaID=42\n    C-&gt;&gt;SR: GET /schemas/ids/42\n    SR--&gt;&gt;C: Schema v2 定义\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: 用 Schema v2 解码消息</pre><p><strong>Confluent Schema Registry 配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 生产者配置&#10;props.put(&quot;schema.registry.url&quot;, &quot;http://schema-registry:8081&quot;);&#10;props.put(&quot;value.serializer&quot;, &quot;io.confluent.kafka.serializers.KafkaAvroSerializer&quot;);&#10;&#10;// 消费者配置&#10;props.put(&quot;schema.registry.url&quot;, &quot;http://schema-registry:8081&quot;);&#10;props.put(&quot;value.deserializer&quot;, &quot;io.confluent.kafka.serializers.KafkaAvroDeserializer&quot;);&#10;props.put(&quot;specific.avro.reader&quot;, &quot;true&quot;);&#10;&#10;// 设置兼容性策略（在 Schema Registry 中）&#10;curl -X PUT -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  --data &#39;{&quot;compatibility&quot;: &quot;BACKWARD&quot;}&#39; \\&#10;  http://schema-registry:8081/config/orders-value\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生产者配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schema.registry.url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schema-registry:8081\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"value.serializer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"io.confluent.kafka.serializers.KafkaAvroSerializer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费者配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schema.registry.url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schema-registry:8081\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"value.deserializer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"io.confluent.kafka.serializers.KafkaAvroDeserializer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"specific.avro.reader\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置兼容性策略（在 Schema Registry 中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">curl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X PUT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">H </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  --</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"compatibility\": \"BACKWARD\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//schema-registry:8081/config/orders-value</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"json-schema-宽松演进\">JSON Schema 宽松演进</h2><p>JSON 没有强制 Schema，但可以通过 JSON Schema 或 Tolerant Reader 模式实现安全演进：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Tolerant Reader：只读自己关心的字段，忽略未知字段&#10;interface OrderEvent {&#10;  order_id: string;&#10;  user_id: string;&#10;  amount: number;&#10;  // 不要用 [key: string]: any 但也不要对未知字段报错&#10;}&#10;&#10;function parseOrderEvent(raw: unknown): OrderEvent {&#10;  if (typeof raw !== &#39;object&#39; || raw === null) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;Invalid event format&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  const obj = raw as Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  return {&#10;    order_id: String(obj.order_id ?? &#39;&#39;),&#10;    user_id: String(obj.user_id ?? &#39;&#39;),&#10;    amount: Number(obj.amount ?? 0),&#10;    // 忽略 raw 中的其他字段&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Tolerant Reader：只读自己关心的字段，忽略未知字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 不要用 [key: string]: any 但也不要对未知字段报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseOrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'object'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Invalid event format'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> obj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> raw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj.order_id </span><span style=\"col