"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleV1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(env.Payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"2.x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleV2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(env.Payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Errorf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"不支持的 Schema 版本: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, env.SchemaVersion)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"schema-演进操作流程\">Schema 演进操作流程</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 设计</td>\n<td>确认变更类型</td>\n<td>向后兼容优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 验证</td>\n<td>Schema Registry 兼容性检查</td>\n<td>拒绝不兼容变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 双写</td>\n<td>生产者同时写新旧字段</td>\n<td>过渡期兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 升级消费者</td>\n<td>消费者支持新字段</td>\n<td>无需停机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 清理</td>\n<td>移除旧字段</td>\n<td>完成迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配合<a href=\"async-observability\">异步系统可观测性</a>监控升级过程中的解析错误率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Schema 演进的核心原则是<strong>向后兼容优先</strong>——优先使用新增字段、避免删除和重命名。Protobuf 通过字段编号实现强兼容保证；Avro 结合 Schema Registry 提供运行时动态解析；JSON 通过 Tolerant Reader 模式实现宽松兼容。无论选哪种方案，都应在 CI 中加入 Schema 兼容性检查，将不兼容变更拦截在上线之前。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消息 Schema 演进策略","id":"消息-schema-演进策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 兼容性类型","id":"schema-兼容性类型"},{"level":2,"text":"安全的 Schema 变更操作","id":"安全的-schema-变更操作"},{"level":2,"text":"Protobuf Schema 演进","id":"protobuf-schema-演进"},{"level":2,"text":"Avro 与 Schema Registry","id":"avro-与-schema-registry"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON Schema 宽松演进","id":"json-schema-宽松演进"},{"level":2,"text":"版本化消息信封","id":"版本化消息信封"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 演进操作流程","id":"schema-演进操作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"背压与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/backpressure-flow-control"},"next":{"title":"异步系统可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/async-observability"}}